# Generated from the ticket files in `.tickets/` and regenerated on every ticket
# update. Never merge it -- keep whatever this side has and let the next
# regeneration settle the difference.
#
# The leading underscore sorts it above the tickets it summarises, and it lives
# beside them so its links are plain sibling filenames.
#
# NOTE: this attribute alone does nothing. `ours` is not one of git's built-in merge
# drivers (those are text, binary and union), so every clone that will merge this repo
# also needs, once:
#
#     git config merge.ours.driver true
#
# .git/config is not a committable file, which is why the requirement is written here.
.tickets/_TICKETS-BY-STATUS.md merge=ours
